WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
PixelMug Studio is the local workspace for running a Bot, serving a WebApp,
deploying MicroPython, and reading logs.

00:12.000 --> 00:28.000
Sign in with the Bubble account that owns your test Bot and PixelMug.

00:28.000 --> 00:47.000
My Bubble shows account devices and Bots. Tokens stay only for this Studio session.

00:47.000 --> 01:10.000
Choose the project root, Bot, phone-reachable WebApp address,
and automatic device code.

01:10.000 --> 01:27.000
Start the agent, then link a compatible device.
Account ownership alone is not a Bot binding.

01:27.000 --> 01:50.000
Studio uploads the contents of mpy and runs the main program
on the linked PixelMug.

01:50.000 --> 02:10.000
Green paths show active state. WebApp and MPY paths appear
as those services become ready.

02:10.000 --> 02:31.000
Use Bot, WebApp, and device logs to find the failing layer.

02:31.000 --> 02:40.000
Update one device for MPY-only changes.
Stop the agent before changing settings.
